  "description": {
    "en": "Solinco Tour Bite Diamond Rough is a textured evolution of Tour Bite designed around a new Diamond Rough surface treatment. The diamond-textured construction increases spin and ball bite while an innovative co-polyester composition enhances pocketing, feel and playability. It retains the durable, high-performance DNA of Tour Bite while adding a more aggressive surface interaction with the ball. Available in 1.20, 1.25 and 1.30 mm gauges.",

    "zh": "Solinco Tour Bite Diamond Rough 是 Tour Bite 的 Diamond Rough 纹理强化版本，通过新的钻石纹理表面进一步提升旋转和咬球能力。创新共聚酯配方同时加强持球感、手感和可打性，在保留 Tour Bite 高耐久与高性能特点的基础上，提供更强的球面摩擦与旋转反馈。产品提供 1.20、1.25 与 1.30 毫米三种线径。"
  },

